    "DefaultText": "Flooded Ford"
  },
  "CardDescription": {
    "ParentObjectID": "cmcClayShoalFlood",
    "LocalizationKey": "CMC_ClayShoalFlood_CardDescription",
    "DefaultText": "The spring thaw has swollen the river over the shoal, drowning the ford between Clay Shoal and Sodden Hollow under fast brown water. Camp at the bank and wait for the floodwaters to fall, or lay a Plank Causeway across it and cross dry. Once the ford is open it stays open for the rest of the spring — but the next thaw scours it out again."
  },
